50","id":3215422127,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_p3Kv","user":{"login":"HatAndTie","id":126703589,"node_id":"U_kgDOB41X5Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126703589?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HatAndTie","html_url":"https://github.com/HatAndTie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HatAndTie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HatAndTie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HatAndTie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HatAndTie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HatAndTie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HatAndTie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HatAndTie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HatAndTie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HatAndTie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T19:39:44Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T19:39:44Z","body":"> Can we enable texture repeat only if the region is also enabled?\r\n\r\nEnabling repeat automatically with Regions would also affect it when using an Big Atlas and the region to limit it to a smaller one. If it's only enabled when the region is larger than the texture it's probably fine. But at that point that's a lot of convoluted logic to determine if repeat should be used or not.\r\n\r\n> It's probably OK to add as an option, but since there are quite a lot of properties in SpriteBase3D already, it's likely better to figure out a sensible default automatically if we have a way to do it.\r\n\r\nGiven that SpriteBase3D is based on SpriteBase2D, where both of those settings exist in tandem (be it as a common setting of all CanvasItems), I don't see why only a single one would be included without the other. SpriteBase3D having too many properties is more a problem of organization i would say, as it doesn't 